is enabled.

the double a number for a number N is a number M if
    M = N * 2.

the square of a number N is a number M if
    M = N * N.

the age category for an age N is a text if
    N < 13
    and the text is equal to "child"
    otherwise N < 20
    and the text is equal to "teenager"
    otherwise N < 65
    and the text is equal to "adult"
    otherwise the text is equal to "senior".

can enter venue if
    the person age is a number N
    and N >= 21
    and has valid ID.

the local pi is 3.14159.

the area of circle with a radius R is a number N if
    the local pi is a number M
    and N = M * R * R.

the factorial of a num N is a number M if
    0 is equal to N
    and M is equal to 1
    otherwise a num K = N - 1
    and the factorial of K is a number P
    and M = N * P.

the maximum of two numbers for a number N with a number M is a value if
    N > M
    and the value is equal to N
    otherwise the value is equal to M.

